    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a classic adventure in this pixel-art JRPG. Explore a vibrant world, catch some fish and battle a diverse array of enemies.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey, you will explore a rich variety of forests, mountains, waters, caves, and dungeons. Small villages and prosperous cities. You will also collect various valuable resources through fishing, mining, and farming.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will meet many different enemies as you travel through the lands. The game features a fast-paced, turn-based battle system, where enemies have unique elemental weaknesses. Magic and various buffs/debuffs play a big role in battles. Tailor your party members' unique magic abilities with the help of different elemental orbs.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16-bit graphic style </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    A vast world to explore </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Every character has his/her unique side quest </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Open-world game-play based on exploration  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Optional side quests  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Tailor your party members' unique magic abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    World based on Slavic and Nordic tales </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Fast-paced, turn-based battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Lots of wonders, adventure, and exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a classic adventure in this pixel-art JRPG. Explore a vibrant world, catch some fish and battle a diverse array of enemies.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey, you will explore a rich variety of forests, mountains, waters, caves, and dungeons. Small villages and prosperous cities. You will also collect various valuable resources through fishing, mining, and farming.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will meet many different enemies as you travel through the lands. The game features a fast-paced, turn-based battle system, where enemies have unique elemental weaknesses. Magic and various buffs/debuffs play a big role in battles. Tailor your party members' unique magic abilities with the help of different elemental orbs.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16-bit graphic style </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    A vast world to explore </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Every character has his/her unique side quest </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Open-world game-play based on exploration  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Optional side quests  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Tailor your party members' unique magic abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    World based on Slavic and Nordic tales </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Fast-paced, turn-based battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Lots of wonders, adventure, and exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Lagoda Odyssey is a turn-based RPG, made in a classic pixel-art style. Embark on an adventure across a vibrant world. Fight enemies in strategic, fast-paced battles. Collect resources through exploration, fishing, and mining.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
